{"municipality_code":"28382","pref":"兵庫県","city":"播磨町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"播磨町には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・石碑・案内板に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では浜田彦蔵や松浦竹松に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「大中遺跡（播磨大中古代の村）」や「兵庫県立考古博物館」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。 さらに、「海苔」や「ワカメ」といった名物や食文化に触れると、その土地らしい暮らしまで感じられるでしょう。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":3,"rank":1530,"percentile":17.1,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":31,"rank":545,"percentile":70.9,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":10,"rank":1624,"percentile":11.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":4,"rank":1499,"percentile":15.1,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":1,"rank":1445,"percentile":12.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":8,"rank":1236,"percentile":32.7,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":